  /* IFERR|WHENERR â¦ [ELSE â¦] END â body if soft fail (OK==0 or LAST_ERR).
   * IFOK|WHENOK â¦ [ELSE â¦] END â body if clean success.
   * Usability: multi-line soft recovery without IF OK == 0 / TRY CATCH glue. */
